      "body": "![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9db79e34-aedb-43bd-9010-4367ab69cd35)\n\nA FOSS, lightweight, and intuitive screen recorder with a native look and feel. Built with SwiftUI and ScreenCaptureKit. \n\n• Lives in your menu bar.\n• Record system audio and microphone simultaneously\n• Content filtering to exclude specific windows\n• No account required\n• No data collection\n• 2.91 MB dmg xD.\n\nLink: https://jsattler.github.io/BetterCapture/\nRepo: https://github.com/jsattler/BetterCapture",
